Hello all,

Found this thread really helpful in terms of re-ordering the individuals and populations in my data. Thank you. However, I did not completely understand the part where you want them arranged in a specific order and not alphabetical. How do you re-level the pop factor to the order you like and then use in the brackets?

Deo

